BLD-shape_guards_by_phase.content:
Links: prep across the tree it walks (prep §6.2 item 3); geotag and merge at the workspace root at startup (geotag §13;
merge precondition 0a), and through the handoff (geotag §7.2; merge precondition 3). Missing managed folders: prep §6.2
item 7, geotag §13, merge precondition 0c.

DEF-managed_folders.content:
The **managed folders** are the workspace's media folders, each with a fixed role: the **inbox**, where a dump arrives;
the strays folder; **missing metadata**, for media with no capture time; **redundant JPEGs**; **videos by date**;
**photos by date**; and **photos by destination**, the staging the user sorts photos into and merge empties into the
library.
